# Operations Officer: "When this creature enters, draw a card" (CR 603.6a, 121.1) and "Whenever this creature
# attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it" (CR 603.4, 508.1). Bot1 takes the odd turns: four Plains are played on turns
# 1, 3, 5 and 7, with the draw step of 3, 5 and 7 adding three cards, so the hand holds six before the cast (the
# Officer and five Plains). It is cast for exactly four, the pool empty after the cast, and the enters trigger draws
